WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:03,110
Which university did last year's strong students finally enter?

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,540
Qingyun Academy

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:09,550
Eight million is already the limit of our mall’s budget this year.

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,540
What if I can get into Qingyun University?

5
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,580
Do you still need to negotiate the endorsement fee?

6
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:21,960
You don't need this expression

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,960
I just said if

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,960
If I get admitted to Qingyun University

9
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,990
What about the endorsement fee?

10
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:29,790
If you can get into Qingyun

11
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:32,690
The endorsement fee can reach 15 million

12
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:35,690
In addition, your membership period can also be extended to five years

13
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:36,690
So be it

14
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:38,690
You add a clause in the contract

15
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,690
If I get admitted to Qingyun University

16
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:42,690
Then the conditions will be based on what you just said.

17
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:43,690
If you fail the exam

18
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:45,690
Then just follow the previous conditions.

19
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:46,940
No problem

20
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:55,880
Take a look

21
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,880
No problem

22
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,880
Just sign
